<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-Aug 96 budget gap 121 bln HUF - Fin Min.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-Aug 96 budget gap 121 bln HUF - Fin Min.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The accumulated deficit of Hungary's central state budget was 121 billion forints for January-August of 1996, down from 206.2 billion forints in the same period last year, the Finance Ministry said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>BUDGET (bln forints) Jan-Aug 96 Jan-July 96  Jan-Aug 95</p>
<p>    REVENUES		 1,237	1,094	    895</p>
<p>    EXPENDITURES	   1,358	1,196	  1,101</p>
<p>    BALANCE		   -121	 -102	   -206</p>
<p>NOTE - The budget revenues do not include privatisation revenues.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
